cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "Globally consistent normalization references for LCA from unit-process LCI databases"
abstract: "Code and aggregated data to derive globally consistent normalization references for life cycle assessment (LCA) directly from unit-process life cycle inventory databases, demonstrated with ecoinvent 3.8 cut-off and the Brightway 2.5 framework."
